d entirely in R  Resident  GARY LETTS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST and AXILLARY CONTENTS  LEFT  MOD RADICAL MAST PART B  BREAST  LEFT  ADD  INFER  MARGIN    BIOPSY PART C  LYMPH NODES   ADD  AXILLARY    EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
