emorrhagic tissue that is 6cm to the closest posterior and 1 8cm to the closest anterior margins  The remainder of the breast is fibrous  Also within the same container there are three unoriented  unremarkable fragments of skin that aggregate to 14 x 9 x 0 6cm  No lymph nodes are grossly appreciated in the upper outer quadrant  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of breast near skin in the central area of the breast   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of firm tissue at the lateral aspect of the cavity to closest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of cavity to closest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative section of cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of bright yellow discoloration adjacent to cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of firm tissue extending from cavity to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire hemorrhagic area in lower inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative breast parenchyma from lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of breast parenchyma from upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire nipple   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of breast parenchyma from central area  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 17   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 12 58 45PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Left   Simple Mastectomy  report_end  , Unchecked.
