ision reveals a firm  yellow  well demarcated mass with an irregular border  The mass measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 6cm in dimension  Centrally there is a hemorrhagic region  measuring REMOVED_DATE in diameter  In addition  there are regions of yellow chalky  slightly firm fat between the mass and the overlying skin incision  The mass appears to abut the inferior inked margin  In addition  the mass is 0 3cm from the closest deep margin The tumor mass is 5 0cm from the superior margin  Sectioning through the remainder of the breast parenchyma reveals focal regions where there is increased white  rubbery fibrosis  No other nodules or firm areas are identified grossly  Multiple lymph nodes are identified within the axillary tail region  the largest of these measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm and the smallest measures 0 1cm in diameter  Section Code A E   tumor and inferior and deep margins F   medial superior quadrant G   medial inferior quadrant  near tumor H   lateral inferior quadrant I   lateral superior quadrant J   nipple K   biopsy site  skin L P   axillary tail lymph nodes Resident  C  Diana Jordan  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  WHITE 03 OPERATING ROOM REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  Peter Hedberg  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST TISSUE   report_end  , Unchecked.
