ral Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  07 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 14 52 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm yellow red fragment of breast tissue  The specimen is oriented with a long stitch marking the lateral position and a short stitch marking the superior position  a guide wire is in place  The specimen was inked as follows  anterior black  posterior blue  inferior green  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a yellow interior with a firm gritty white nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm in the lateral end of the specimen  The specimen is submitted in toto from lateral to medial in cassettes A E  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin   are 3 unoriented fragments of fibroadipose tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm in aggregate  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes F H  Gross Description by  PAUL MICHAELS  MD Resident  DAVID COON  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN  , Unchecked.
